// Title: Events around the pivot time
// Size: full
// Why: Everything that happened within the window: processes starting and exiting, connections, registry keys written, tasks created, tools first seen. Filter the grid on a PID or a word to follow one thread of activity.
// FalsePositives: Registry key LastWriteTime is per key (not per value) and can be bumped by benign changes.
let pivot = iff(isempty("{PivotTime}"), AcquiredAt, todatetime("{PivotTime}"));
let window = {WindowMinutes} * 1m;
Timeline()
| where Time between ((pivot - window) .. (pivot + window))
| order by Time asc
